---
error: true
---

// So is refining an unresolved one past the discovery bound.
// Discard the encoded bytes: the writer fails, and whether the decoder
// has emitted its first batch by then is a race.
// The batches arrive on stdin: a `from_file` subpipeline would
// emit each unresolved batch separately.
load_stdin
read_feather
write_feather
discard
